  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4602.56 “Net electricity generation” means the gross generation minus any electricity output consumed in any way to generate the electricity.\n\nSource. #9283, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9444, eff 4-3-09 (from Env-A 4602.57); ss by #10468, eff 1-1-14 (from Env-A 4602.51); ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20 (from Env-A 4602.57)",
